  "cues": {
    "0.1": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 0.0,
        "global_frame": 0,
        "end_frame": 27,
        "text": "哈囉大家"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 0.92,
        "global_sec": 0.92,
        "global_frame": 27,
        "end_frame": 55,
        "text": "在上個單元"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 1.84,
        "global_sec": 1.84,
        "global_frame": 55,
        "end_frame": 134,
        "text": "我們已經聊過了關於程式語言的分工"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 4.48,
        "global_sec": 4.48,
        "global_frame": 134,
        "end_frame": 186,
        "text": "網頁的御三家是什麼"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 6.2,
        "global_sec": 6.2,
        "global_frame": 186,
        "end_frame": 276,
        "text": "以及各個平台分別適合哪一些語言"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 9.2,
        "global_sec": 9.2,
        "global_frame": 276,
        "end_frame": 364,
        "text": "前端和後端各自負責什麼樣的項目"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 12.16,
        "global_sec": 12.16,
        "global_frame": 364,
        "end_frame": 393,
        "text": "那在這個單元"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 13.12,
        "global_sec": 13.12,
        "global_frame": 393,
        "end_frame": 470,
        "text": "我們要更深入的來瞭解一件事情"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 15.68,
        "global_sec": 15.68,
        "global_frame": 470,
        "end_frame": 541,
        "text": "就是Web前端跟Web後端"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 18.04,
        "global_sec": 18.04,
        "global_frame": 541,
        "end_frame": 595,
        "text": "到底各自是怎麼運作的呢"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 19.84,
        "global_sec": 19.84,
        "global_frame": 595,
        "end_frame": 672,
        "text": "以及他們之間又是怎麼彼此溝通的呢"
      }
    ],
    "1.1": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 23.5,
        "global_frame": 705,
        "end_frame": 789,
        "text": "首先,我們就先從前端開始說起吧"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.08,
        "global_sec": 26.58,
        "global_frame": 797,
        "end_frame": 843,
        "text": "好奇你有沒有想過"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 4.86,
        "global_sec": 28.36,
        "global_frame": 850,
        "end_frame": 950,
        "text": "當你在瀏覽器上面輸入網址並按下Enter的時候"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 8.46,
        "global_sec": 31.96,
        "global_frame": 958,
        "end_frame": 1012,
        "text": "網頁就很快出現了"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 10.76,
        "global_sec": 34.26,
        "global_frame": 1027,
        "end_frame": 1119,
        "text": "這不到三秒鐘的時間到底發生了什麼事情呢"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 14.34,
        "global_sec": 37.84,
        "global_frame": 1135,
        "end_frame": 1173,
        "text": "說起來其實很簡單喔"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 15.88,
        "global_sec": 39.38,
        "global_frame": 1181,
        "end_frame": 1204,
        "text": "一開始"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 16.9,
        "global_sec": 40.4,
        "global_frame": 1211,
        "end_frame": 1234,
        "text": "你的瀏覽器"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 17.92,
        "global_sec": 41.42,
        "global_frame": 1242,
        "end_frame": 1319,
        "text": "也就是你電腦或者是手機上開的那個Chrome"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 20.74,
        "global_sec": 44.24,
        "global_frame": 1327,
        "end_frame": 1357,
        "text": "或者是Safari"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 22.26,
        "global_sec": 45.76,
        "global_frame": 1372,
        "end_frame": 1465,
        "text": "會去伺服器上面把前端的程式下載下來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.6,
        "global_sec": 49.1,
        "global_frame": 1473,
        "end_frame": 1549,
        "text": "然後會在你的瀏覽器裡面把它執行起來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 28.36,
        "global_sec": 51.86,
        "global_frame": 1555,
        "end_frame": 1624,
        "text": "才會變成你眼前所看到的那個畫面"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 31.44,
        "global_sec": 54.94,
        "global_frame": 1648,
        "end_frame": 1771,
        "text": "那在這個過程當中有沒有覺得很像是你在手機上面下載App啊"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 36.04,
        "global_sec": 59.54,
        "global_frame": 1786,
        "end_frame": 1848,
        "text": "基本上他們的邏輯會是一樣的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 38.36,
        "global_sec": 61.86,
        "global_frame": 1855,
        "end_frame": 1917,
        "text": "只不過會有一個很關鍵的小差異"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 41.16,
        "global_sec": 64.66,
        "global_frame": 1939,
        "end_frame": 2016,
        "text": "Web前端的下載量非常非常的輕量"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 43.98,
        "global_sec": 67.48,
        "global_frame": 2024,
        "end_frame": 2070,
        "text": "輕量到什麼程度呢"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 45.78,
        "global_sec": 69.28,
        "global_frame": 2078,
        "end_frame": 2147,
        "text": "輕量到你幾乎感覺不到它有在下載"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 48.34,
        "global_sec": 71.84,
        "global_frame": 2155,
        "end_frame": 2224,
        "text": "它就這樣瞬間的會出現在你的眼前"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 51.16,
        "global_sec": 74.66,
        "global_frame": 2239,
        "end_frame": 2285,
        "text": "所以你每次開網頁"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 52.94,
        "global_sec": 76.44,
        "global_frame": 2293,
        "end_frame": 2385,
        "text": "其實都是在做一個下載然後執行的動作"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 56.28,
        "global_sec": 79.78,
        "global_frame": 2393,
        "end_frame": 2446,
        "text": "只是因為它速度很快"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 58.32,
        "global_sec": 81.82,
        "global_frame": 2454,
        "end_frame": 2493,
        "text": "所以你沒有特別感覺到"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 59.86,
        "global_sec": 83.36,
        "global_frame": 2500,
        "end_frame": 2577,
        "text": "而且不管你是用電腦還是手機"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 62.68,
        "global_sec": 86.18,
        "global_frame": 2585,
        "end_frame": 2617,
        "text": "只要有瀏覽器"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 64.0,
        "global_sec": 87.5,
        "global_frame": 2625,
        "end_frame": 2678,
        "text": "就能夠跑Web前端的程式"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 66.04,
        "global_sec": 89.54,
        "global_frame": 2686,
        "end_frame": 2778,
        "text": "這也是為什麼網頁會比App更容易跨裝置"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 69.62,
        "global_sec": 93.12,
        "global_frame": 2793,
        "end_frame": 2847,
        "text": "因為其實同一份的前端程式"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 71.68,
        "global_sec": 95.18,
        "global_frame": 2855,
        "end_frame": 2916,
        "text": "就可以在各種裝置上面跑起來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 73.98,
        "global_sec": 97.48,
        "global_frame": 2924,
        "end_frame": 3076,
        "text": "所以不需要再去特別分iOS 或 Android去分別各寫一套不同的程式喔"
      }
    ],
    "1.2": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 103.63,
        "global_frame": 3109,
        "end_frame": 3201,
        "text": "另外這邊也想跟你分享一個額外的小概念"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.58,
        "global_sec": 107.21,
        "global_frame": 3216,
        "end_frame": 3323,
        "text": "其實啊你所看到的那些網頁或者是App上面的設計"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 7.42,
        "global_sec": 111.05,
        "global_frame": 3331,
        "end_frame": 3439,
        "text": "像是按鈕的形狀、顏色的配置、畫面的排版"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 11.26,
        "global_sec": 114.89,
        "global_frame": 3446,
        "end_frame": 3470,
        "text": "以及佈局"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 12.28,
        "global_sec": 115.91,
        "global_frame": 3477,
        "end_frame": 3547,
        "text": "通常都不是前端設計師所負責的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 15.1,
        "global_sec": 118.73,
        "global_frame": 3562,
        "end_frame": 3677,
        "text": "因為前端設計師負責的任務是把設計寫成程式"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 19.2,
        "global_sec": 122.83,
        "global_frame": 3685,
        "end_frame": 3715,
        "text": "並且讓他跑起來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 20.74,
        "global_sec": 124.37,
        "global_frame": 3731,
        "end_frame": 3800,
        "text": "但至於介面的設計長什麼樣子"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 23.3,
        "global_sec": 126.93,
        "global_frame": 3808,
        "end_frame": 3938,
        "text": "這其實是會有另外一個叫做UI設計師的角色會先規劃好"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 27.9,
        "global_sec": 131.53,
        "global_frame": 3946,
        "end_frame": 3992,
        "text": "也就是所謂的介面設計師"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 30.16,
        "global_sec": 133.79,
        "global_frame": 4013,
        "end_frame": 4151,
        "text": "UI設計師在完成設計之後會交付一份設計稿給工程師"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 35.02,
        "global_sec": 138.65,
        "global_frame": 4159,
        "end_frame": 4274,
        "text": "然後工程師再依照這個設計稿去把產品實際的做出來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 39.38,
        "global_sec": 143.01,
        "global_frame": 4290,
        "end_frame": 4375,
        "text": "所以這兩個角色一般來說會是分工合作的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 42.7,
        "global_sec": 146.33,
        "global_frame": 4390,
        "end_frame": 4490,
        "text": "但當然有的時候也會有些大神他會身兼多職"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 46.3,
        "global_sec": 149.93,
        "global_frame": 4498,
        "end_frame": 4597,
        "text": "也就是設計、前端、後端全部都自己來喔"
      }
    ],
    "2.1": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 154.1,
        "global_frame": 4623,
        "end_frame": 4713,
        "text": "講完前端了之後,接下來我們來看看後端吧"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.0,
        "global_sec": 157.1,
        "global_frame": 4713,
        "end_frame": 4833,
        "text": "後端與前端最大的差別就在於它運作的位置"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 7.0,
        "global_sec": 161.1,
        "global_frame": 4833,
        "end_frame": 4923,
        "text": "前端的程式會下載到你的瀏覽器裡面"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 10.0,
        "global_sec": 164.1,
        "global_frame": 4923,
        "end_frame": 5013,
        "text": "所以你可以看得到它,也可以直接操作"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 13.0,
        "global_sec": 167.1,
        "global_frame": 5013,
        "end_frame": 5073,
        "text": "但是後端就不一樣囉"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 15.0,
        "global_sec": 169.1,
        "global_frame": 5073,
        "end_frame": 5133,
        "text": "它是跑在遠端的伺服器上"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 17.0,
        "global_sec": 171.1,
        "global_frame": 5133,
        "end_frame": 5253,
        "text": "你可以把伺服器想像成是一台放在資料中心"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 21.0,
        "global_sec": 175.1,
        "global_frame": 5253,
        "end_frame": 5313,
        "text": "24小時都不會關機的電腦"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 23.0,
        "global_sec": 177.1,
        "global_frame": 5313,
        "end_frame": 5373,
        "text": "你平時不會直接接觸到它"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.0,
        "global_sec": 179.1,
        "global_frame": 5373,
        "end_frame": 5463,
        "text": "但你每次的點擊、每次的操作"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 28.0,
        "global_sec": 182.1,
        "global_frame": 5463,
        "end_frame": 5523,
        "text": "其實都是在跟它溝通"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 30.0,
        "global_sec": 184.1,
        "global_frame": 5523,
        "end_frame": 5613,
        "text": "那它也一直在幕後默默的幫你處理事情喔"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 33.0,
        "global_sec": 187.1,
        "global_frame": 5613,
        "end_frame": 5673,
        "text": "而後端最重要的一個特質"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 35.0,
        "global_sec": 189.1,
        "global_frame": 5673,
        "end_frame": 5793,
        "text": "就是它要同時接收來自各種地方的請求"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 39.0,
        "global_sec": 193.1,
        "global_frame": 5793,
        "end_frame": 5883,
        "text": "像是電腦上的瀏覽器、手機上的瀏覽器"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 42.0,
        "global_sec": 196.1,
        "global_frame": 5883,
        "end_frame": 5943,
        "text": "iOS的App、Android App"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 44.0,
        "global_sec": 198.1,
        "global_frame": 5943,
        "end_frame": 6063,
        "text": "所有這些客戶端都會往同一個後端去送出請求"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 48.0,
        "global_sec": 202.1,
        "global_frame": 6063,
        "end_frame": 6153,
        "text": "後端會統一接收然後統一處理"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 51.0,
        "global_sec": 205.1,
        "global_frame": 6153,
        "end_frame": 6213,
        "text": "在上個單元我沒有提到說"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 53.0,
        "global_sec": 207.1,
        "global_frame": 6213,
        "end_frame": 6273,
        "text": "怎麼去快速的辨識前端跟後端"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 55.0,
        "global_sec": 209.1,
        "global_frame": 6273,
        "end_frame": 6363,
        "text": "最簡單的方式就是把網路給關起來"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 58.0,
        "global_sec": 212.1,
        "global_frame": 6363,
        "end_frame": 6393,
        "text": "可以觀察看看"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 59.0,
        "global_sec": 213.1,
        "global_frame": 6393,
        "end_frame": 6453,
        "text": "如果在沒有網路的狀態之下"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 61.0,
        "global_sec": 215.1,
        "global_frame": 6453,
        "end_frame": 6543,
        "text": "我們應該就沒有辦法看到社群的動態"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 64.0,
        "global_sec": 218.1,
        "global_frame": 6543,
        "end_frame": 6603,
        "text": "查詢購物的清單、不能訂票"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 66.0,
        "global_sec": 220.1,
        "global_frame": 6603,
        "end_frame": 6753,
        "text": "因為這些功能都需要後端的伺服器參與才有辦法完成喔"
      }
    ],
    "2.2": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 225.2,
        "global_frame": 6756,
        "end_frame": 6809,
        "text": "那後端到底在做什麼呢?"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 2.04,
        "global_sec": 227.24,
        "global_frame": 6817,
        "end_frame": 6878,
        "text": "後端其實有兩個主要的大任務"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 4.36,
        "global_sec": 229.56,
        "global_frame": 6886,
        "end_frame": 6940,
        "text": "第一個是業務的邏輯"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 6.4,
        "global_sec": 231.6,
        "global_frame": 6948,
        "end_frame": 7009,
        "text": "業務邏輯說白了就是規則"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 8.7,
        "global_sec": 233.9,
        "global_frame": 7017,
        "end_frame": 7078,
        "text": "譬如說你在買票的時候"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 11.0,
        "global_sec": 236.2,
        "global_frame": 7086,
        "end_frame": 7170,
        "text": "系統怎麼會知道說這張票有沒有被賣出去"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 14.08,
        "global_sec": 239.28,
        "global_frame": 7178,
        "end_frame": 7239,
        "text": "你的帳號是不是真實登入的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 16.38,
        "global_sec": 241.58,
        "global_frame": 7247,
        "end_frame": 7324,
        "text": "這些判斷都會是業務邏輯的範圍"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 19.2,
        "global_sec": 244.4,
        "global_frame": 7332,
        "end_frame": 7439,
        "text": "通常我們會用PHP、Python之類的語言來寫"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 23.56,
        "global_sec": 248.76,
        "global_frame": 7462,
        "end_frame": 7501,
        "text": "第二個是資料庫"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.08,
        "global_sec": 250.28,
        "global_frame": 7508,
        "end_frame": 7546,
        "text": "資料庫顧名思義"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 26.62,
        "global_sec": 251.82,
        "global_frame": 7554,
        "end_frame": 7600,
        "text": "就是存放資料的地方"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 28.36,
        "global_sec": 253.56,
        "global_frame": 7606,
        "end_frame": 7668,
        "text": "更重要的是要快速找到"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 30.92,
        "global_sec": 256.12,
        "global_frame": 7683,
        "end_frame": 7714,
        "text": "舉個例子來說"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 32.22,
        "global_sec": 257.42,
        "global_frame": 7722,
        "end_frame": 7791,
        "text": "假如你有一堆的書全部都堆在地上"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 34.78,
        "global_sec": 259.98,
        "global_frame": 7799,
        "end_frame": 7852,
