        "local_sec": 1.36,
        "global_sec": 469.26,
        "global_frame": 14077,
        "end_frame": 14146,
        "text": "我們來談一下一個很重要的觀念"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.64,
        "global_sec": 471.54,
        "global_frame": 14146,
        "end_frame": 14223,
        "text": "也是想要請你特別留意的事情"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 6.2,
        "global_sec": 474.1,
        "global_frame": 14223,
        "end_frame": 14333,
        "text": "就是像登入驗證、付款、權限控制等等"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 9.88,
        "global_sec": 477.78,
        "global_frame": 14333,
        "end_frame": 14400,
        "text": "這些跟隱私相關的重要操作"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 12.12,
        "global_sec": 480.02,
        "global_frame": 14400,
        "end_frame": 14419,
        "text": "拜託"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 12.76,
        "global_sec": 480.66,
        "global_frame": 14419,
        "end_frame": 14489,
        "text": "千萬千萬一定要放在後端做"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 15.08,
        "global_sec": 482.98,
        "global_frame": 14489,
        "end_frame": 14523,
        "text": "不能放在前端喔"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 16.2,
        "global_sec": 484.1,
        "global_frame": 14523,
        "end_frame": 14554,
        "text": "為什麼呢?"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 17.24,
        "global_sec": 485.14,
        "global_frame": 14554,
        "end_frame": 14632,
        "text": "這其實跟前端的一個本質特性會有關"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 19.84,
        "global_sec": 487.74,
        "global_frame": 14632,
        "end_frame": 14686,
        "text": "還記得前端是什麼嗎?"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 21.64,
        "global_sec": 489.54,
        "global_frame": 14686,
        "end_frame": 14711,
        "text": "我們會說"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 22.48,
        "global_sec": 490.38,
        "global_frame": 14711,
        "end_frame": 14807,
        "text": "前端是被下載到你瀏覽器上的程式"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.68,
        "global_sec": 493.58,
        "global_frame": 14807,
        "end_frame": 14824,
        "text": "所以"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 26.24,
        "global_sec": 494.14,
        "global_frame": 14824,
        "end_frame": 14875,
        "text": "它既然是被下載下來的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 27.96,
        "global_sec": 495.86,
        "global_frame": 14875,
        "end_frame": 14899,
        "text": "那基本上"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 28.76,
        "global_sec": 496.66,
        "global_frame": 14899,
        "end_frame": 14941,
        "text": "只要有有心人士"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 30.16,
        "global_sec": 498.06,
        "global_frame": 14941,
        "end_frame": 14980,
        "text": "懂相關的技術"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 31.44,
        "global_sec": 499.34,
        "global_frame": 14980,
        "end_frame": 15009,
        "text": "就可以在本地端"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 32.4,
        "global_sec": 500.3,
        "global_frame": 15009,
        "end_frame": 15053,
        "text": "任意的去修改它"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 33.88,
        "global_sec": 501.78,
        "global_frame": 15053,
        "end_frame": 15095,
        "text": "舉個例子來說"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 35.28,
        "global_sec": 503.18,
        "global_frame": 15095,
        "end_frame": 15179,
        "text": "如果你下載了一份文件到你的電腦的話"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 38.08,
        "global_sec": 505.98,
        "global_frame": 15179,
        "end_frame": 15257,
        "text": "那你想怎麼修改就怎麼修改對吧?"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 40.68,
        "global_sec": 508.58,
        "global_frame": 15257,
        "end_frame": 15322,
        "text": "所以前端程式也是一樣的道理"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 42.84,
        "global_sec": 510.74,
        "global_frame": 15322,
        "end_frame": 15370,
        "text": "只要你下載到手邊"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 44.44,
        "global_sec": 512.34,
        "global_frame": 15370,
        "end_frame": 15456,
        "text": "任何人都會有機會去改動它"
      }
    ],
    "4.2": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 515.23,
        "global_frame": 15457,
        "end_frame": 15508,
        "text": "那再講得更具體一點"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 1.72,
        "global_sec": 516.95,
        "global_frame": 15508,
        "end_frame": 15569,
        "text": "如果今天是一個電商網站"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.76,
        "global_sec": 518.99,
        "global_frame": 15569,
        "end_frame": 15619,
        "text": "你在購買商品的時候"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 5.4,
        "global_sec": 520.63,
        "global_frame": 15619,
        "end_frame": 15706,
        "text": "前端其實是會顯示價格和總金額"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 8.32,
        "global_sec": 523.55,
        "global_frame": 15706,
        "end_frame": 15784,
        "text": "但如果有人在前端上面動手腳"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 10.92,
        "global_sec": 526.15,
        "global_frame": 15784,
        "end_frame": 15847,
        "text": "把價格從1000改到10"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 13.0,
        "global_sec": 528.23,
        "global_frame": 15847,
        "end_frame": 15895,
        "text": "然後再送出訂單"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 14.6,
        "global_sec": 529.83,
        "global_frame": 15895,
        "end_frame": 15967,
        "text": "如果系統只相信前端的資料"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 17.0,
        "global_sec": 532.23,
        "global_frame": 15967,
        "end_frame": 16030,
        "text": "那就真的會用10塊錢成交哦"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 19.12,
        "global_sec": 534.35,
        "global_frame": 16030,
        "end_frame": 16058,
        "text": "這種情況"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 20.04,
        "global_sec": 535.27,
        "global_frame": 16058,
        "end_frame": 16142,
        "text": "其實就是直接會影響到金流上面的問題"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 22.84,
        "global_sec": 538.07,
        "global_frame": 16142,
        "end_frame": 16187,
        "text": "會非常嚴重"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 24.36,
        "global_sec": 539.59,
        "global_frame": 16187,
        "end_frame": 16208,
        "text": "所以啊"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.04,
        "global_sec": 540.27,
        "global_frame": 16208,
        "end_frame": 16253,
        "text": "像是價格的計算"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 26.56,
        "global_sec": 541.79,
        "global_frame": 16253,
        "end_frame": 16285,
        "text": "付款的金額"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 27.6,
        "global_sec": 542.83,
        "global_frame": 16285,
        "end_frame": 16324,
        "text": "庫存的數量"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 28.92,
        "global_sec": 544.15,
        "global_frame": 16324,
        "end_frame": 16402,
        "text": "使用者權限等等這種關鍵的邏輯"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 31.52,
        "global_sec": 546.75,
        "global_frame": 16402,
        "end_frame": 16491,
        "text": "全部都必須放在後端去重新驗證"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 34.48,
        "global_sec": 549.71,
        "global_frame": 16491,
        "end_frame": 16580,
        "text": "因為後端的程式是跑在伺服器上面的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 37.44,
        "global_sec": 552.67,
        "global_frame": 16580,
        "end_frame": 16643,
        "text": "一般的使用者是沒有辦法接觸到"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 39.56,
        "global_sec": 554.79,
        "global_frame": 16643,
        "end_frame": 16689,
        "text": "也沒有辦法篡改"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 41.08,
        "global_sec": 556.31,
        "global_frame": 16689,
        "end_frame": 16745,
        "text": "所以你可以這樣子理解"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 42.96,
        "global_sec": 558.19,
        "global_frame": 16745,
        "end_frame": 16826,
        "text": "就會是前端負責讓你系統操作"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 45.64,
        "global_sec": 560.87,
        "global_frame": 16826,
        "end_frame": 16929,
        "text": "而後端會確保這些操作是合法而且安全的哦"
      }
    ],
    "5.1": [
      {
        "local_sec": 0.0,
        "global_sec": 565.63,
        "global_frame": 16969,
        "end_frame": 17076,
        "text": "好,那這個單元我們又更瞭解了前端跟後端一點點"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 3.58,
        "global_sec": 569.21,
        "global_frame": 17076,
        "end_frame": 17168,
        "text": "一樣,來幫大家重點的複習一下喔"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 6.66,
        "global_sec": 572.29,
        "global_frame": 17168,
        "end_frame": 17206,
        "text": "第一個重點是"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 7.92,
        "global_sec": 573.55,
        "global_frame": 17206,
        "end_frame": 17317,
        "text": "Web前端就是被你下載到瀏覽器執行的程式"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 11.62,
        "global_sec": 577.25,
        "global_frame": 17317,
        "end_frame": 17370,
        "text": "它就像是一個迷你的App"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 13.38,
        "global_sec": 579.01,
        "global_frame": 17370,
        "end_frame": 17411,
        "text": "每次打開的時候"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 14.76,
        "global_sec": 580.39,
        "global_frame": 17411,
        "end_frame": 17462,
        "text": "網頁都會重新下載一次"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 16.46,
        "global_sec": 582.09,
        "global_frame": 17462,
        "end_frame": 17521,
        "text": "而且速度非常的快"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 18.42,
        "global_sec": 584.05,
        "global_frame": 17521,
        "end_frame": 17573,
        "text": "手機跟電腦都有瀏覽器"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 20.16,
        "global_sec": 585.79,
        "global_frame": 17573,
        "end_frame": 17669,
        "text": "所以Web前端天生就是跨裝置的"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 23.36,
        "global_sec": 588.99,
        "global_frame": 17669,
        "end_frame": 17709,
        "text": "再來第二個是"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 24.68,
        "global_sec": 590.31,
        "global_frame": 17709,
        "end_frame": 17742,
        "text": "Web後端"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 25.78,
        "global_sec": 591.41,
        "global_frame": 17742,
        "end_frame": 17853,
        "text": "它是跑在一個24小時不停機的伺服器上面"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 29.48,
        "global_sec": 595.11,
        "global_frame": 17853,
        "end_frame": 17967,
        "text": "會統一接收來自於瀏覽器、iOS、Android"
      },
      {
        "local_sec": 33.28,
        "global_sec": 598.91,
        "global_frame": 17967,
        "end_frame": 18021,
